# The AppRole credential accounts logs in to the cell's Vault with, delivered as
# a secret the way every other accounts secret is — never as a mounted file.
#
# The composition publishes both halves (on a cell, from its own secret store
# through the configuration plane). They are never printed and never logged: the
# login body carries them, and a refused login is diagnosed by its status alone.
#
# accounts refuses to start outside the local environment when either half is
# missing, naming the key. Locally the composed `vault` service is reached with
# a token instead (VAULT_AUTH_METHOD=token, the default), so these stay at their
# placeholder values and are unused.
VAULT_APPROLE_ROLE_ID=local-dev-unused-role-id
VAULT_APPROLE_SECRET_ID=local-dev-unused-secret-id
